# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file
version: v1.25.0

ignore:
  SNYK-JS-QUILL-14927397:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          Not reachable from this codebase. CVE-2025-15056 affects QuillJS
          getHTML()/getSemanticHTML(), which return unescaped HTML for formula and
          video blots. Neither function is called here: editor content is stored
          and consumed exclusively as Delta (structured JSON), never as exported
          HTML. No fix is available from QuillJS maintainers; will re-evaluate
          when a patch is released.
        expires: 2027-09-02T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-01-27T00:00:00.000Z
